# Render with:  vhs docs/demo.tape   (run from the repo root)
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set Framerate 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Type "uv run python docs/demo.py 2>/dev/null"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 11s
